      "sourceHash": "90139d30e42b73a4",
      "translationZh": "Swyx [00:11:01]：对，非常有效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "194787084b6b8ab9",
      "translationZh": "Vibhu [00:11:02]：对。我没想到这篇博客文章会这么让人分心。抱歉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8a4c2fa48a9005d",
      "translationZh": "Anastasis [00:11:05]：对，不过，在那些例子里，在 Gen-1 上，我最喜欢的例子之一是这两种，如果你往上看到模式三或模式二，那里有一个分镜用例，人们会制作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
